    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kingdom of Velvet Chains</strong> is a dark fantasy visual novel of lust, power, betrayal, and arcane seduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/531fcd8f006f27928252c053937a3ae1.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the heart of <strong>Amarta</strong> \u2014 a once-glorious kingdom now teetering on the brink of civil war. Its throne belongs to <strong>Queen Faemeliel</strong>, a young elven monarch forged in grief and secrecy after the death of her father. She rules with both the sword and an ancient, forbidden magic: a curse that lets her possess the bodies of others\u2026 and drain life through intimate contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/289b660b880cc5e6c8aec37eb34ed911.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At her side stands <strong>Aegness</strong>, her loyal protector and most trusted warrior. In the shadows of the court, <strong>Maedithir</strong>, the aging royal sorcerer, watches closely \u2014 ever wary of the dark forces at play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But danger brews from within. Faemeliel\u2019s estranged sister, <strong>Ilyrana</strong>, once quiet and overlooked, now burns with long-repressed resentment. Abandoned by her allies and ignored by the crown, she turns to rebellion \u2014 and into the arms of Aimer, a sharp-tongued poet who weaves veiled dissent into his verses. Together, they become a growing threat to Faemeliel\u2019s reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/f6bcc87ab8f3805a2c104d66d6f0c7d6.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, a mysterious sorceress named <strong>Kandhella</strong> arrives at the royal court, offering her aid to Faemeliel in her struggle for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But her true motives lie hidden beneath a veil of deception and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then\u2026 there\u2019s <strong>You</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wanderer of mortal blood, caught in events far beyond your station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You saved the queen\u2019s life by chance \u2014 or perhaps fate \u2014 and by ancient elven custom, she now owes you a lifedebt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That bond cannot be broken. Tradition demands she serve you \u2014 fulfill your every desire \u2014 for the rest of her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to honor that vow may threaten her rule, her reputation\u2026 and the future of Amarta itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/94e2cd4da1249ab4a026209bc71518c5.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Story of Power, Lust, and Betrayal</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a dark, character-driven fantasy where every choice echoes through the fate of a crumbling elven kingdom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Dialogue</strong><br>Experience the drama with emotional, professional voice acting that brings each character to life \u2014 from the noble queen to her fiercest enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning\u00a0 Artwork</strong><br>Beautifully illustrated scenes and character portraits capture the sensuality and grandeur of elven high fantasy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated Intimate Encounters</strong><br>Erotic scenes come alive with smooth, hand-crafted animations designed for emotional impact and maximum heat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Fantasy Soundtrack</strong><br>A rich musical score blends haunting melodies with sweeping orchestral themes to set the tone for every chapter.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Relationships and Intrigue</strong><br>Form bonds, break loyalties, and influence the outcome of court politics, rebellion, and forbidden desires.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Magical Themes</strong><br>Wield the power of ancient curses, soul-binding rituals, and seductive magic woven deep into the plot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature, Female-led Eroticism</strong><br>Experience an adult fantasy from a unique perspective where power and sensuality go hand in hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help her secure the realm\u2026 or unravel it from within?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kingdom of Velvet Chains</strong> is a dark fantasy visual novel of lust, power, betrayal, and arcane seduction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/531fcd8f006f27928252c053937a3ae1.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You step into the heart of <strong>Amarta</strong> \u2014 a once-glorious kingdom now teetering on the brink of civil war. Its throne belongs to <strong>Queen Faemeliel</strong>, a young elven monarch forged in grief and secrecy after the death of her father. She rules with both the sword and an ancient, forbidden magic: a curse that lets her possess the bodies of others\u2026 and drain life through intimate contact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/289b660b880cc5e6c8aec37eb34ed911.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At her side stands <strong>Aegness</strong>, her loyal protector and most trusted warrior. In the shadows of the court, <strong>Maedithir</strong>, the aging royal sorcerer, watches closely \u2014 ever wary of the dark forces at play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But danger brews from within. Faemeliel\u2019s estranged sister, <strong>Ilyrana</strong>, once quiet and overlooked, now burns with long-repressed resentment. Abandoned by her allies and ignored by the crown, she turns to rebellion \u2014 and into the arms of Aimer, a sharp-tongued poet who weaves veiled dissent into his verses. Together, they become a growing threat to Faemeliel\u2019s reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/f6bcc87ab8f3805a2c104d66d6f0c7d6.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, a mysterious sorceress named <strong>Kandhella</strong> arrives at the royal court, offering her aid to Faemeliel in her struggle for power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But her true motives lie hidden beneath a veil of deception and magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And then\u2026 there\u2019s <strong>You</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wanderer of mortal blood, caught in events far beyond your station.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You saved the queen\u2019s life by chance \u2014 or perhaps fate \u2014 and by ancient elven custom, she now owes you a lifedebt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That bond cannot be broken. Tradition demands she serve you \u2014 fulfill your every desire \u2014 for the rest of her life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But to honor that vow may threaten her rule, her reputation\u2026 and the future of Amarta itself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3756260/extras/94e2cd4da1249ab4a026209bc71518c5.avif?t=1751354462\" width=615 height=300 /></span><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Story of Power, Lust, and Betrayal</strong><br>Immerse yourself in a dark, character-driven fantasy where every choice echoes through the fate of a crumbling elven kingdom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully Voiced Dialogue</strong><br>Experience the drama with emotional, professional voice acting that brings each character to life \u2014 from the noble queen to her fiercest enemies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning\u00a0 Artwork</strong><br>Beautifully illustrated scenes and character portraits capture the sensuality and grandeur of elven high fantasy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Animated Intimate Encounters</strong><br>Erotic scenes come alive with smooth, hand-crafted animations designed for emotional impact and maximum heat.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original Fantasy Soundtrack</strong><br>A rich musical score blends haunting melodies with sweeping orchestral themes to set the tone for every chapter.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complex Relationships and Intrigue</strong><br>Form bonds, break loyalties, and influence the outcome of court politics, rebellion, and forbidden desires.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Magical Themes</strong><br>Wield the power of ancient curses, soul-binding rituals, and seductive magic woven deep into the plot.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mature, Female-led Eroticism</strong><br>Experience an adult fantasy from a unique perspective where power and sensuality go hand in hand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you help her secure the realm\u2026 or unravel it from within?</p>",
